    {
      "custom": {
        "name": "ADC4_FLASH",
        "pins": [
          {
            "name": "AIN",
            "number": "1",
            "side": "left"
          },
          {
            "name": "CLK",
            "number": "2",
            "side": "left"
          },
          {
            "name": "D0",
            "number": "3",
            "side": "right"
          },
          {
            "name": "GND",
            "number": "4",
            "side": "bottom"
          },
          {
            "name": "D1",
            "number": "5",
            "side": "right"
          },
          {
            "name": "D2",
            "number": "6",
            "side": "right"
          },
          {
            "name": "D3",
            "number": "7",
            "side": "right"
          },
          {
            "name": "VCC",
            "number": "8",
            "side": "top"
          }
        ],
        "prefix": "U",
        "sim": {
          "element": "",
          "kind": "subckt",
          "limits": [
            "デジタルセル (行列の外で計算する素子) で作った動作モデルです。実物の部品ではなく、教材用です。15 個の比較器 (しきい値が電源の k/16 のセル) と、15 個の D フリップフロップ、エンコーダでできています。",
            "満点の電圧 (基準) は、VCC と GND の電位差です。別の基準電圧は取れません。AIN が GND〜VCC の外に出ると、0 か 15 に張り付きます。",
            "AIN の入力抵抗は無限大 (電流が流れない)、比較器にヒステリシスやオフセットはありません。遅延は CLK→出力 20ns の一定値で、サンプルホールドの時間や変換時間は表しません。使わない入力は、GND か電源につないでください。"
          ],
          "name": "ADC4_FLASH",
          "params": {},
          "pins": [
            "1",
            "2",
            "3",
            "4",
            "5",
            "6",
            "7",
            "8"
          ],
          "text": "* ADC4_FLASH teaching model: a 4-bit flash converter. 15 comparators (digital cells whose input threshold is k/16 of the supply) read AIN; a flip-flop per comparator keeps the result at the rising edge of CLK; an encoder turns the thermometer code into a 4-bit number: code = floor(16 * AIN / supply). Delay from CLK to D0..D3 20 ns (a generic value).\n.subckt ADC4_FLASH ain clk d0 gnd d1 d2 d3 vcc\nYc1 buf c1 0 gnd vcc 60 0.0625 0 0 0 ain\nYf1 dff t1 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 c1 clk 0 0\nYc2 buf c2 0 gnd vcc 60 0.125 0 0 0 ain\nYf2 dff t2 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 c2 clk 0 0\nYc3 buf c3 0 gnd vcc 60 0.1875 0 0 0 ain\nYf3 dff t3 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 c3 clk 0 0\nYc4 buf c4 0 gnd vcc 60 0.25 0 0 0 ain\nYf4 dff t4 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 c4 clk 0 0\nYc5 buf c5 0 gnd vcc 60 0.3125 0 0 0 ain\nYf5 dff t5 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 c5 clk 0 0\nYc6 buf c6 0 gnd vcc 60 0.375 0 0 0 ain\nYf6 dff t6 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 c6 clk 0 0\nYc7 buf c7 0 gnd vcc 60 0.4375 0 0 0 ain\nYf7 dff t7 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 c7 clk 0 0\nYc8 buf c8 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 ain\nYf8 dff t8 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 c8 clk 0 0\nYc9 buf c9 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5625 0 0 0 ain\nYf9 dff t9 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 c9 clk 0 0\nYc10 buf c10 0 gnd vcc 60 0.625 0 0 0 ain\nYf10 dff t10 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 c10 clk 0 0\nYc11 buf c11 0 gnd vcc 60 0.6875 0 0 0 ain\nYf11 dff t11 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 c11 clk 0 0\nYc12 buf c12 0 gnd vcc 60 0.75 0 0 0 ain\nYf12 dff t12 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 c12 clk 0 0\nYc13 buf c13 0 gnd vcc 60 0.8125 0 0 0 ain\nYf13 dff t13 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 c13 clk 0 0\nYc14 buf c14 0 gnd vcc 60 0.875 0 0 0 ain\nYf14 dff t14 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 c14 clk 0 0\nYc15 buf c15 0 gnd vcc 60 0.9375 0 0 0 ain\nYf15 dff t15 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 c15 clk 0 0\nYn2 inv nt2 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 t2\nYn4 inv nt4 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 t4\nYn6 inv nt6 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 t6\nYn8 inv nt8 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 t8\nYn10 inv nt10 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 t10\nYn12 inv nt12 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 t12\nYn14 inv nt14 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 t14\nYd3 buf d3 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 td=20n t8\nYb2a and b2a 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 t4 nt8\nYd2 or d2 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 td=20n b2a t12\nYb1a and b1a 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 t2 nt4\nYb1b and b1b 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 t6 nt8\nYb1c and b1c 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 t10 nt12\nYd1 or d1 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 td=20n b1a b1b b1c t14\nYb0_1 and b0_1 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 t1 nt2\nYb0_3 and b0_3 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 t3 nt4\nYb0_5 and b0_5 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 t5 nt6\nYb0_7 and b0_7 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 t7 nt8\nYb0_9 and b0_9 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 t9 nt10\nYb0_11 and b0_11 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 t11 nt12\nYb0_13 and b0_13 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 t13 nt14\nYd0 or d0 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 td=20n b0_1 b0_3 b0_5 b0_7 b0_9 b0_11 b0_13 t15\n.ends ADC4_FLASH"
        }
      },
      "footprint": "DIP-8_W7.62",
      "kind": "Custom",
      "pos": [
        52,
